    "detailed_description": "<h1>Coming soon - Grunn!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Blue drifter is an experimental bounty hunter game set on a harsh rainy planet. Track down criminals with your flying car, and eliminate them to ultimately buy yourself a ticket to outer space, and freedom.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232140/extras/80b7bb6d3709536f9431619a206408fa.poster.avif?t=1726498212\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232140/extras/80b7bb6d3709536f9431619a206408fa.webm?t=1726498212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232140/extras/80b7bb6d3709536f9431619a206408fa.mp4?t=1726498212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10-20 minutes of playtime.<br></li><li> Use a scanner, gun, and vehicle to deal with your targets. <br></li><li> Freely roam a miserable rainy planet.<br></li><li> A very blue and raw aesthetic.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232140/extras/c350ac25322f0cc81d29044611c576b9.avif?t=1726498212\" /></div><br>Sokpop makes a new game every two weeks!<br>Subscribe for 3$ per month at ",
